                          "Citation": "USEPA/Office of Pesticide Programs; Reregistration Eligibility Decision Document - Siduron p.29 EPA 7508P (May 2008). Available from, as of  June 9, 2009: https://www.epa.gov/pesticides/reregistration/status.htm"
