                          "Citation": "United Nations. Treatment and Disposal Methods for Waste Chemicals (IRPTC File). Data Profile Series No. 5. Geneva, Switzerland: United Nations Environmental Programme, Dec. 1985., p. 298"
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "Burning: Small quantities of siduron should be burned and large quantities incinerated in a unit operting at 850 °C equipped with off gas scrubbing equipment. Recommendable method: Incineration. Not recommendable method: Hydrolysis. Peer review: Hydrolysis generates dimethylamine and aniline. (Peer- review conclusions of an IRPTC expert consultation (MAY 1985))",
                          "Markup": [
