                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "/LABORATORY ANIMALS: Acute Exposure/ In skin tests with guinea pigs, application of 10% suspension in dimethylphthalate was not irritating; a 25% suspension was mildly irritating, while a 40% suspension was moderately to strongly irritating. It did not produce allergic contact dermatitis.",
