                          "String": "AEROBIC: Microbial degradation has been reported to occur in soil using C14-labeled siduron(1). In water and soil, microbial degradation has been reported to occur with a half-life of approximately 120-150 days(2). Siduron has a measured field half-life of 90 days(3).",
