                          "Citation": "Humburg, N.E. (ed.). Herbicide Handbook of the Weed Science Society of America. 6th ed. Champaign, IL: Weed Science Society of America, 1989., p. 234"
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "Value": {
                      "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                          "String": "After exposure in a thin film to full sunlight for 56 days, Siduron caused injury to germinating crabgrass identical with that caused by a nonirradiated check sample. Chemical analysis also verified that Siduron was not decomposed by sunlight.",
                          "Markup": [
                            {
                              "Start": 60,
